This directory is a modified fork ("UME Lite", https://github.com/1TRYOUT/firefox-ume-lite)
of the MIT-licensed work above. Fork modifications copyright (c) 2026 1TRYOUT.

Modifications: playback auto-pause is opt-in instead of unconditional, the page
overlay controller is off by default, settings changes now propagate to every
tab through storage events, the unused `alarms`/`activeTab` permissions and the
developer-donation links were removed, and the Chrome build was dropped. The
original copyright notice is retained as the licence requires.
